  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 275°F (135°C).",
    "Season the chicken thighs with salt and black pepper.",
    "In a large Dutch oven, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the chicken thighs, skin-side down, and sear for 2-3 minutes, until browned.",
    "Flip the chicken and add the confit-tomatoes, dark soy sauce, thyme, and bay leaves.",
    "Cover the Dutch oven with a lid and transfer to the preheated oven.",
    "Braise the chicken for 2-3 hours, until tender and falling off the bone.",
    "Remove the chicken from the oven and let it rest for 10-15 minutes, before serving."
